          <description>AWB: leased-bank zone read selector. Raster index y*READ_NUM_ZONE_X+x using the captured grid in AWB_RESULT_STATUS. Allow one core clock after selecting an address. Out-of-grid and untouched entries read zero. [access=rw]</description>
          <addressOffset>0x2430</addressOffset>
